                "description": "change existing user info in system\n### Logic fields update (three-state logic):\n1. **The field was not entered by the user**: ignore, the value in the database does not change\n2. **The value is explicitly passed**: `\"phone_number\": \"+380604356393` -  changing phone number\n3. **passed null**: clears a field in the database\nRestrictions: `full_name` cant be null",
                "consumes": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "produces": [
                    "application/json"
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "users"
                ],
                "summary": "patch user",
